          "sha256": "3edf15db8c02eb3cc7225769416ef6924ef0ebe613cd3430a315389534434727",
          "lines": 1647
        }
      },
      "retrieved": {
        "text": "But low \\(D_t\\) is not automatically good. The agent should divide changes by semantic class:\n\n\\[\nD_t =\nD_{silhouette}+\nD_{shade}+\nD_{detail}+\nD_{FX}.\n\\]\n\nFor a subtle breathing idle, large \\(D_{silhouette}\\) is suspicious; a small \\(D_{shade}\\) may be exactly what is wanted. For an explosion, the opposite constraint applies.\n",
        "sha256": "7efc4789ca70dfd9964abc2bc1100af318306236400e3496f7a0a5654f725e28",
        "start": 1563,
        "end": 1573,
